msgid ""
"Upload your membership agreements, waivers, or code of conduct to the "
"<strong>Sign</strong> app. New members can sign digitally—no printing, "
"scanning, or delays—making onboarding seamless and professional.<br/>\n"
"            <br/>"
msgstr ""
"Upload lidmaatschapsovereenkomsten, afstandsverklaringen of gedragscode in "
"de app <strong>Ondertekenen</strong>. Nieuwe leden kunnen digitaal "
"ondertekenen – zonder printen, scannen of vertragingen – waardoor de "
"onboarding vlot en professioneel verloopt.<br/>\n"
"            <br/>"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use dashboards and reports across <strong>CRM</strong>, <strong>Sales</"
"strong>, and <strong>Subscription</strong> to track critical KPIs like "
"membership growth, churn rate, and event ROI. Make informed decisions faster "
"and\n"
"                optimize what works."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik dashboards en rapporten in <strong>CRM</strong>, <strong>Verkoop</"
"strong> en <strong>Abonnementen</strong> om belangrijke KPI's bij te houden, "
"zoals groei van het aantal leden, ledenverloop en ROI (Return on Investment) "
"van evenementen. Neem sneller weloverwogen beslissingen en optimaliseer wat "
"al werkt."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <strong>Appointments</strong> app to let prospects or members book "
"consultations or tours"
msgstr ""
